'''Brian Mark Smith'''  (born April 23, 1966) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[Los Angeles Rams]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He was selected 48th overall by the Rams in the second round of the [[1989 NFL draft]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=1989 NFL Draft Listing |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/years/1989/draft.htm |access-date=2023-05-26 |website=Pro-Football-Reference.com |language=en}}</ref> Smith played [[college football]] for the [[Auburn Tigers football|Auburn Tigers]].

