'''Brian Allen Treggs''' (born June 11, 1970) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[wide receiver]] who played one season with the [[Seattle Seahawks]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[California Golden Bears football|California Golden Bears]].
